      "id": "seed-1",
      "handle": "honda-cbr650r",
      "title": "HONDA CBR650R",
      "bodyHtml": "<div data-pdp-section=\"details\"><p>Designed for HONDA CBR650R (2024-present).</p><ul><li>Complete seat — replaces your stock seat. Not a cover, not a pad.</li><li>3D-printed TPU lattice structure.</li><li>Made for one specific bike model. Not a universal fit.</li><li>Breathable lattice. Waterproof TPU.</li><li>Produced in our own factory since 1996. IATF 16949 certified.</li></ul></div>\n<div data-pdp-section=\"installation\"><ul><li>Our seat replaces the original seat unit. Install as usual, same as your factory seat.</li></ul><ol><li class=\"pdp-indent\" style=\"text-indent: 24px; list-style-position: inside;\">Remove your original seat following your owner's manual.</li><li class=\"pdp-indent\" style=\"text-indent: 24px; list-style-position: inside;\">Align our new seat and mount it onto the frame the same way you refit the stock seat.</li><li class=\"pdp-indent\" style=\"text-indent: 24px; list-style-position: inside;\">Lock the seat securely. Pull upward firmly to confirm it cannot lift off.</li><li class=\"pdp-indent\" style=\"text-indent: 24px; list-style-position: inside;\">Perform a short low-speed test ride before long-distance riding.</li></ol><ul><li>Tools needed: Same tools used to remove your original seat.</li><li>Important: Do not over-tighten fasteners. Verify seat security before riding.</li></ul></div>",
      "vendor": "HONDA",
      "productCategory": "",
      "type": "Motorcycle Parts",
      "tags": "HONDA, CBR650R, Fitment",
      "published": false,
