      "installationText": "<ul><li>Our seat replaces the original seat unit. Install as usual, same as your factory seat.</li></ul><ol><li class=\"pdp-indent\" style=\"text-indent: 24px; list-style-position: inside;\">Remove your original seat following your owner's manual.</li><li class=\"pdp-indent\" style=\"text-indent: 24px; list-style-position: inside;\">Align our new seat and mount it onto the frame the same way you refit the stock seat.</li><li class=\"pdp-indent\" style=\"text-indent: 24px; list-style-position: inside;\">Lock the seat securely. Pull upward firmly to confirm it cannot lift off.</li><li class=\"pdp-indent\" style=\"text-indent: 24px; list-style-position: inside;\">Perform a short low-speed test ride before long-distance riding.</li></ol><ul><li>Tools needed: Same tools used to remove your original seat.</li><li>Important: Do not over-tighten fasteners. Verify seat security before riding.</li></ul>",
